# LF everywhere, in the repo and in the working copy, regardless of core.autocrlf. Skill files,
# hooks, and scripts are consumed by Node, sh, and Python; CRLF breaks the hook's shebang line
# and makes generated manifest.json differ from what the tool writes.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
